[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64[Ee][Cc]/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
artifacts/
 
# Build results in nested folders
**/[Bb]in/*
**/[Oo]bj/*
**/[Ll]og/*
**/[Ll]ogs/*
 
# Visual Studio
.vs/
Generated\ Files/
Generated/
 
# Rider / ReSharper / dotCover / NCrunch
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user
*.dotCover
_NCrunch_*
.*crunch*.local.xml
nCrunchTemp_*
 
